<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS3" title="In Appendix F Additional Case Studies ‣ CORA: Analyzing and bridging thinking-answer gap in Multimodal RLVR via Consistency-Oriented Reasoning Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.3 </span>Case Study on MathVision</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS4" title="In Appendix F Additional Case Studies ‣ CORA: Analyzing and bridging thinking-answer gap in Multimodal RLVR via Consistency-Oriented Reasoning Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.4 </span>Case Study on MathVista</span></a></li>
