<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S1.p3.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ CORA: Analyzing and bridging thinking-answer gap in Multimodal RLVR via Consistency-Oriented Reasoning Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>.
</span></li>
